{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25905","headline":"和段相公登武担寺西台 · 杨汝士","name":"和段相公登武担寺西台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清净此道宫，层台复倚空。\n偶时三伏外，列席九霄中。\n平视云端路，高临树杪风。\n自怜荣末座，前日别池笼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨汝士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}